==Release information==
This card was one of five cards that could be pulled from Promo-A Vol. 3 packs; these were made available as part of the [[Blastoise Drop Event]], which ran from January 1 to 15, 2025.

==Trivia==
===Origin===
*{{m|Growl}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Eevee}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

